(QGCoder demo - simple threading pass)
(Units: millimetres, absolute positioning)

G21 G90 G17 G40 G94

S500 M3             (spindle on, clockwise)

G0 Z10.000
G0 X0.000 Y0.000
G1 Z-2.000 F100
G33 X20.000 K-1.000   (single threading pass, 1 mm pitch)
G0 Z10.000
G0 X0.000 Y0.000

M5                (spindle off)
M2                (end of program)
